  "Threat / Self-healing / Interrupts": ["Bedrohung / Selbstheilung / Unterbrechungen","Amenaza / Autocuración / Interrupciones","Dreiging / Zelfgenezing / Onderbreken","Minaccia / Autocura / Interruzioni","Menace / Soins personnels / Interruptions"],
