  "Ranged strikes / Accuracy": ["Fernangriffe / Genauigkeit","Ataques a distancia / Precisión","Afstandsaanvallen / Nauwkeurigheid","Colpi a distanza / Precisione","Attaques à distance / Précision"],
  "Heavy hits / Vulnerability": ["Schwere Treffer / Verwundbarkeit","Golpes fuertes / Vulnerabilidad","Zware treffers / Kwetsbaarheid","Colpi pesanti / Vulnerabilità","Coups puissants / Vulnérabilité"],
